    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">keywords</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Scope note:
Keywords or tags used to describe some item. (schema.org)

Implementation note:
Domain obo:BFO_0000001 (entity), the top-level class: used on data portals, data feeds and RIG models. Range obo:BFO_0000001 (entity), the top-level class: values are schema:DefinedTerm, academic discipline, standard, license and media type.
</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000001" />
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000001" />
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://schema.org/" />
  </rdf:Property>
