    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Scope note:
The start date and time of the item (in ISO 8601 date format). (schema.org)

Implementation note:
Domain obo:BFO_0000001 (entity), the top-level class: used on events, event series and news articles. All values are xsd:date.
</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000001" />
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date" />
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://schema.org/" />
