An additional type for the item, typically used for adding more specific types from external vocabularies. (schema.org)

Implementation note:
Domain obo:BFO_0000001 (entity), the top-level class: in the profiled models used on publications. Range rdfs:Resource: values are untyped IRIs.
</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000001" />
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource" />
