A pointer to another, somehow related product (or multiple products). (schema.org)

Implementation note:
Domain obo:BFO_0000001 (entity), the top-level class: used on several RIG models. Range obo:BFO_0000001 (entity), the top-level class: values are news articles, publications, software, media and others.
</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000001" />
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000001" />
