A resource from which this work is derived or from which it is a modification or adaptation. (schema.org)

Implementation note:
Domain obo:BFO_0000001 (entity), the top-level class: used on data portals and service products. Range obo:BFO_0000001 (entity), the top-level class: values are software.
</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000001" />
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000001" />
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://schema.org/" />
  </rdf:Property>
